{'symbol': 'SYK', 'date': '2023-05-02 08:00:00', 'title': 'STRYKER COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF CERUS ENDOVASCULAR', 'text': "KALAMAZOO, MICHIGAN, USA, MAY 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- STRYKER (NYSE:SYK), ONE OF THE WORLD'S LEADING MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANIES, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF CERUS ENDOVASCULAR LTD., A PRIVATELY HELD, COMMERCIAL-STAGE, MEDICAL DEVICE COMPANY ENGAGED IN THE DESIGN AND DEVELOPMENT OF NEUROINTERVENTIONAL DEVICES FOR THE TREATMENT OF INTRACRANIAL ANEURYSMS."}